  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Issuing a purgeDatastream request with a malformed startDT (e.g. \"1999\") results in a 500 error when using FeSL AuthZ but a 400 error when using the legacy AuthZ.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "With the legacy AuthZ, DateUtility returns an IllegalArgumentException, which is eventually translated into a 400 (Bad request; unable to fulfill REST API request), e.g.:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "INFO 2012-08-30 16:25:56.150 [http-8080-1] (DefaultManagement) Completed getDatastream(pid: test-rest:1, datastreamID: testMalformedDates, asOfDateTime: null)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "WARN 2012-08-30 16:25:56.176 [http-8080-6] (BaseRestResource) Bad request; unable to fulfill REST API request",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "java.lang.IllegalArgumentException: Unparseable date: \"1999\"",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at org.fcrepo.utilities.DateUtility.parseDateOrNull(DateUtility.java:210) ~[fcrepo-common-3.6.1-SNAPSHOT.jar:na]",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at org.fcrepo.server.rest.DatastreamResource.deleteDatastream(DatastreamResource.java:286) ~[fcrepo-server-3.6.1-SNAPSHOT.jar:na]",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "However, with FeSL AuthZ, the date parsing is done by the xacml library which results in a ParseException that eventually translates into in a 500, e.g.:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "INFO 2012-08-30 16:41:07.482 [http-8080-6] (DefaultManagement) Completed getDatastream(pid: test-rest:1, datastreamID: testMalformedDates, asOfDateTime: null)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "ERROR 2012-08-30 16:41:07.501 [http-8080-7] (PurgeDatastream) ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "java.text.ParseException: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at com.sun.xacml.attr.DateTimeAttribute.strictParse(DateTimeAttribute.java:413) ~[sunxacml-1.2-melcoe.jar:na]",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at com.sun.xacml.attr.DateTimeAttribute.getInstance(DateTimeAttribute.java:379) ~[sunxacml-1.2-melcoe.jar:na]",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at org.fcrepo.server.security.xacml.pep.rest.objectshandlers.PurgeDatastream.handleRequest(PurgeDatastream.java:108) ~[fcrepo-security-pep-3.6.1-SNAPSHOT.jar:na]",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at org.fcrepo.server.security.xacml.pep.rest.PEP.doFilter(PEP.java:160) [fcrepo-security-pep-3.6.1-SNAPSHOT.jar:na]",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "We need to decide what is the appropriate response here and then be consistent about it.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
